{"suttaId":"tha-ap206","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7477,7495],"vripara":"15"},"segments":{"tha-ap206:0.3":"Taraṇiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap206:1.1":"“Atthadassī tu bhagavā, dvipadindo narāsabho;","tha-ap206:1.3":"Purakkhato sāvakehi, gaṅgātīramupāgami.","tha-ap206:2.1":"“Samatitti kākapeyyā, gaṅgā āsi duruttarā;","tha-ap206:2.3":"Uttārayiṃ bhikkhusaṅghaṃ, buddhañca dvipaduttamaṃ.","tha-ap206:3.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap206:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, taraṇāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap206:4.1":"“Teraseto kappasate, pañca sabbobhavā [sabbhogavā (sī.)] ahuṃ;","tha-ap206:4.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap206:5.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave asmiṃ, jātohaṃ brāhmaṇe kule;","tha-ap206:5.3":"Saddhiṃ tīhi sahāyehi, pabbajiṃ satthu sāsane.","tha-ap206:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap206:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā taraṇiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti;","tha-ap206:8.1":"Taraṇiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
